{
  "case": "cart-free-shipping",
  "title": "购物车满 99 包邮：差一点时提示还差多少，满额后运费为 0",
  "platform": "web",
  "kind": "acceptance",
  "origin": {
    "id": "DEMO-1",
    "title": "示例需求：满 99 包邮"
  },
  "why": "演示 acceptkit 的用例形态：人话断言 + 观测规格；项目扩展提供的诊断通道；以及要求的证据拿不到时降级、记为阻塞。",
  "classifications": {
    "carrier": [
      "web"
    ],
    "lever": [
      "threshold"
    ]
  },
  "tree": [
    {
      "op": "打开购物车页，合计 98.99 元",
      "tags": {
        "carrier": "web",
        "lever": "threshold"
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "id": "E1",
          "assert": "页面提示「再买 0.01 元包邮」，运费显示 8.00",
          "seen_at": "购物车页的提示条和运费一栏",
          "observe": {
            "op": "page-text",
            "params": {
              "url": "file://{project}/site/index.html?total=98.99",
              "wait_ms": 800,
              "eval": "({tip: document.getElementById('tip').textContent, shipping: document.getElementById('shipping').textContent})"
            },
            "checks": [
              {
                "pick": "tip",
                "predicate": {
                  "eq": "再买 0.01 元包邮"
                }
              },
              {
                "pick": "shipping",
                "predicate": {
                  "eq": "8.00"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E2",
          "assert": "被测对象自己报告的状态：未包邮",
          "via": "diag",
          "why_not_ui": "「是否包邮」是被测对象内部的判定结果，用户看到的只是由它渲染出来的提示语；这条直接读判定本身（项目扩展 pack.mjs 提供的 demo-diag 通道）",
          "observe": {
            "op": "app-diag",
            "params": {},
            "checks": [
              {
                "pick": "free",
                "predicate": {
                  "eq": false
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "op": "合计改为 99.00 元，重新打开页面",
          "tags": {
            "carrier": "web",
            "lever": "threshold"
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "id": "E3",
              "assert": "页面提示「已满 99 元，免运费」，运费显示 0.00",
              "seen_at": "购物车页的提示条和运费一栏",
              "observe": {
                "op": "page-text",
                "params": {
                  "url": "file://{project}/site/index.html?total=99",
                  "wait_ms": 800,
                  "eval": "({tip: document.getElementById('tip').textContent, shipping: document.getElementById('shipping').textContent})"
                },
                "checks": [
                  {
                    "pick": "tip",
                    "predicate": {
                      "eq": "已满 99 元，免运费"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "pick": "shipping",
                    "predicate": {
                      "eq": "0.00"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "E4",
              "assert": "订单后台结算出的运费为 0（要求被测对象直接报告，证据强度至少 S1）",
              "via": "diag",
              "why_not_ui": "页面上的运费只是展示，结算以订单后台为准，界面上看不到结算结果；示例站点没有后台，诊断通道读不到这一项，会降级读页面上的运费（S2），强度不够，记为阻塞",
              "observe": {
                "op": "app-diag",
                "params": {
                  "need": "settled_shipping"
                },
                "fallback": [
                  {
                    "op": "page-text",
                    "params": {
                      "eval": "({shipping: document.getElementById('shipping').textContent})"
                    },
                    "checks": [
                      {
                        "pick": "shipping",
                        "predicate": {
                          "eq": "0.00"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "checks": [
                  {
                    "pick": "settled_shipping",
                    "predicate": {
                      "eq": 0
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "min_strength": "S1"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
